  "revision": 2,
  "changes": [
   "server started with KNOTREL_MAX_NODES = nodes + 100000 (default 100000 rejected the new IDs of mixed50 toggles and feeder catch-up at 100k)",
   "background import reads the current ETag from GET /v1/stats when its configuration starts (an earlier configuration's events made the stored ETag stale)",
   "a background feeder request refused with 503 is retried unchanged after 10 ms and counted; other failures stop the activity and are recorded with status and error code",
   "per-item error results and no-op mutations (changed:false) are counted",
   "toggle phase read before the pass boundary flips it (revision 1 cut the last owned item of the first pass before linking it: one no-op per client)",
   "each configuration toggles fresh extra-edge IDs; a client resends a refused batch body unchanged"
  ]
